{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22484","headline":"西掖早秋直夜书意 · 白居易","name":"西掖早秋直夜书意","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凉风起禁掖，新月生宫沼。\n夜半秋闇来，万年枝嫋嫋。\n炎凉递时节，钟鼓交昏晓。\n遇圣惜年衰，报恩愁力小。\n素餐无补益，朱绶虚缠绕。\n冠盖栖野云，稻粱养山鸟。\n量能私自省，所得已非少。\n五品不爲贱，五十不爲夭。\n若无知足心，贪求何日了。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22484.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22484","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}